Moria is a game very *SIMILAR* to Hack. However it is not 
just a variation, thereof. If you enjoy Hack, and have a 
PC (I use Hack on a PC, myself), chances are you will find
great enjoyment in PC Moria.


For all intensive purposes, they are descendents of the same
Rogue game (I think, I honestly dont know the history). However,
some minor differences;

       Hack's dungeon levels are about the size of one computer
       screen. Each Moria level is about 5 times wider and about
      times "taller" (about 15 times the area!).

       Moria has no 'little dog'

       The devices, acoutraments (sp.?), etc are Much more
       varied - there are about 10-20 times the magic devices
       weapons armor, etc.




      AND   Moria 5.2.2 has color characters.


